Collision design: bmax=6 and bmax=10 bohr; four shards of 64 trajectories per bmax: total N=512.
Each shard: four independent thermal parents, 16 collisions per parent, 20 ps initial thermalization, 1 ps sampling step, up to 20 ps unthermostatted collision per child.
